{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49868","headline":"蝶恋花 六 · 冯延巳","name":"蝶恋花 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁道闲情抛弃久，每到春来，惆怅还依旧。\n日日花前常病酒，不辞镜里朱颜瘦。\n河畔青芜堤上柳，爲问新愁，何事年年有。\n独立小楼风满袖，平林新月人归後。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯延巳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49868.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49868","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}